IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-cpc-interface`
IMPORT `ea-types`
IMPORT `ea-presumptions-burden`

-- Tests for ea-presumptions-burden.l4 (Evidence Act 1893, ss 4, 81 to 92, 103 to 114, 116, 116A).
-- Expected values are read off the Act's text and illustrations.  Generated by generators/ea_tests_2.py.

§ `4. The three kinds of presumption`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court may presume` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court may presume` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `proof of it is called for`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court may presume` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court is to presume` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court is to presume` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `the court is to presume` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `the treatment of a presumed fact` `conclusive proof` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `regarded as proved`

#ASSERT `evidence may be given to disprove the presumed fact` `the court may presume`

#ASSERT `evidence may be given to disprove the presumed fact` `the court is to presume`

#ASSERT NOT `evidence may be given to disprove the presumed fact` `conclusive proof`

§ `81 to 92. Presumptions as to documents`

`s81 a certified copy in form` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the document purports to be a certificate, certified copy or other document declared by law admissible as evidence of a particular fact` IS TRUE
    `it purports to be duly certified by a public officer in Singapore or by an authorised officer in Malaysia` IS TRUE
    `it is substantially in the form and purports to be executed in the manner directed by law` IS TRUE
    `the document purports to be a record or memorandum of the evidence, or of part of the evidence, given by a witness in a judicial proceeding or before an officer authorised by law to take such evidence` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be a statement or confession by a prisoner or accused person, taken in accordance with law` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be signed by a Judge or Magistrate or by an authorised officer` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be the Government Gazette of Singapore or of Malaysia or of a part of the Commonwealth, a Gazette issued by the local government of a part of Malaysia or the Commonwealth, or a newspaper or journal` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be a document directed by law to be kept by a person` IS FALSE
    `it is kept substantially in the form required by law` IS FALSE
    `it is produced from proper custody` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be one that by the law in force in England or Northern Ireland would be admissible in proof of a particular in a court there without proof of the seal, stamp, signature or official character` IS FALSE
    `the map or plan purports to be made by the authority of the Government` IS FALSE
    `the map or plan is made for the purposes of a cause or other proceeding, civil or criminal` IS FALSE
    `the publication purports to be printed or published under the authority of the government of a country and to contain a law of that country` IS FALSE
    `the publication purports to contain an official or authoritative report of a decision of a court of a country` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be a power of attorney executed before and authenticated by a notary public or a court, Judge, Magistrate or consular officer of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the document purports to be a certified copy of a judicial record of a country not forming part of the Commonwealth, certified in the manner commonly in use in that country as certified by a representative of the President or of Her Britannic Majesty in or for that country` IS FALSE
    `the book is one to which the court may refer for information on matters of public or general interest, or the map or chart is published and its statements are relevant facts` IS FALSE
    `the message was forwarded from a telegraph office to the person to whom it purports to be addressed` IS FALSE
    `the document was called for after notice to produce given under section 68 and was not produced` IS FALSE
    `the document purports or is proved to be 30 years old` IS FALSE
    `it is produced from a custody the court in the particular case considers proper` IS FALSE

