§ `114. Paternity`

`s114(1)(a) born during the marriage` MEANS `Paternity Facts` WITH
    `the person was born during the continuance of a valid marriage between the person's mother and a man` IS TRUE
    `the person was born within 280 days after the dissolution of the marriage, the mother remaining unmarried` IS FALSE
    `the person's parenthood is determined under the Status of Children (Assisted Reproduction Technology) Act 2013` IS FALSE

`s114(1)(b) born within 280 days after dissolution` MEANS `Paternity Facts` WITH
    `the person was born during the continuance of a valid marriage between the person's mother and a man` IS FALSE
    `the person was born within 280 days after the dissolution of the marriage, the mother remaining unmarried` IS TRUE
    `the person's parenthood is determined under the Status of Children (Assisted Reproduction Technology) Act 2013` IS FALSE

